            <div xml:id="d265">

                <pb facs="0292" n="284" sameAs="frus:frus1938v01/pg284"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">138 Spain/932: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Counselor of Embassy in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-05-17T19:00:00-04:00">May 17, 1938—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>442. Consulate’s 16th re passports. You are authorized in your discretion take up
                    matter with Ministry of State and to take any other action which might result in
                    recovery of any of passports.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
